// 1-path.exam solved by simulated annealing instead: keep the two files' problems identical.
// Q16 (i): four exams whose conflicts form a path, two batches. Feasible (a path is 2-colourable).
problem path_annealing batches 2
students Ana Rui Eva
exam Algebra   weight 2 { Ana }
exam Calculus  weight 3 { Ana Rui }
exam Physics   weight 1 { Rui Eva }
exam Chemistry weight 2 { Eva }

solver { method annealing reads 50 sweeps 10000 seed 7 }
